// # Bind hi through a same-fn string let
//
// Logline: Bind s to hi and print s so emit-x86 can lower the same-fn string let.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No concat.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Bind s to the hi string.
//   3. Print s.
//
// residual: no concat.

pub fn main() {
    let s = "hi";
    println(s);
}
